  "aiContextParagraph": "Prime Minister Narendra Modi has traveled to Manila, Philippines, to participate in the 23rd India-ASEAN summit, which is a component of the broader 49th ASEAN summit. During his address, the Prime Minister highlighted the necessity for regional cooperation and stability, reaffirming India's commitment to the unity of the association as part of the nation's Act East Policy. Leaders at the summit are engaged in discussions concerning defense ties and digital integration. Additionally, the event serves as a focal point for international diplomacy, as officials prepare for a potential Quad meeting following the arrival of United States President Donald Trump. This visit marks the first direct meeting between Prime Minister Modi and President Trump since the recent midterm elections in the United States, which shifted the domestic political environment.",
